# Code owners — ENFORCEMENT PENDING GitHub configuration (docs/github-setup.md, "security-owners" steps).
# Until the Meronatic organisation exists, "@MERONATIC-ORG/security-owners" is a placeholder: replace it with the real
# team (Muhammad Shahzad plus a second Meronatic owner), then turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for main.
#
# Approving a dependency-audit exception is an edit to docs/security/audit-exceptions.json. This rule makes that edit
# impossible to merge without an owner's review (recheck R4-2). The same applies to everything that decides what the
# security checks run, or how access and the browser security policy are enforced (review of candidate 2, L3).

